41740a41d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-78903797-f443-5edc-811b-4978f0fb3a9c" :answer/id #uuid "78903797-f443-5edc-811b-4978f0fb3a9c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{21}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-925973ab-54a7-5189-8264-2452fb2bf425" :question/id #uuid "925973ab-54a7-5189-8264-2452fb2bf425" :question/math-academy-id "q-68816" :question/problem "$\\sqrt[3]{4}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{5}=$" :question/worked-solution "The product of cube roots of two positive numbers is equal to the cube root of the product of the numbers. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[3]{4}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{5}=\\sqrt[3]{4\\cdot 5}=\\sqrt[3]{20}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-08476d29-657c-5db4-aed2-3ab6e228d5b4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-08476d29-657c-5db4-aed2-3ab6e228d5b4" :answer-field/id #uuid "08476d29-657c-5db4-aed2-3ab6e228d5b4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3931a08c-1746-53a0-a810-a9e2bd1cf320" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e65b94d8-2457-553f-8ebb-4a4bd8089c85" "answer-70e97821-0da3-5b84-b380-1cf495d5fa6d" "answer-607709b0-5bd7-5471-ba8b-dd7b1fa5eff3" "answer-3931a08c-1746-53a0-a810-a9e2bd1cf320" "answer-4ea3373f-a353-572b-9137-c4b8fd7b27a2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e65b94d8-2457-553f-8ebb-4a4bd8089c85" :answer/id #uuid "e65b94d8-2457-553f-8ebb-4a4bd8089c85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt[3]{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-70e97821-0da3-5b84-b380-1cf495d5fa6d" :answer/id #uuid "70e97821-0da3-5b84-b380-1cf495d5fa6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-607709b0-5bd7-5471-ba8b-dd7b1fa5eff3" :answer/id #uuid "607709b0-5bd7-5471-ba8b-dd7b1fa5eff3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\sqrt[3]{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3931a08c-1746-53a0-a810-a9e2bd1cf320" :answer/id #uuid "3931a08c-1746-53a0-a810-a9e2bd1cf320" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[3]{20}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4ea3373f-a353-572b-9137-c4b8fd7b27a2" :answer/id #uuid "4ea3373f-a353-572b-9137-c4b8fd7b27a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[3]{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-06ab6f14-038b-5470-aa09-81f5114b5c61" :question/id #uuid "06ab6f14-038b-5470-aa09-81f5114b5c61" :question/math-academy-id "q-68819" :question/problem "$\\sqrt[3]{32}=$" :question/worked-solution "The cube root of a product of two numbers is equal to the product of the cube roots of the numbers. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[3]{32}=\\sqrt[3]{8\\cdot 4}=\\sqrt[3]{8}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{4}=2\\sqrt[3]{4}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d546f0b0-ceb1-5cf5-a5d6-1c0d00b10531"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d546f0b0-ceb1-5cf5-a5d6-1c0d00b10531" :answer-field/id #uuid "d546f0b0-ceb1-5cf5-a5d6-1c0d00b10531" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-fa9544c1-384a-5ecd-af3f-afa3bcc8e278" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b47be4fa-2c44-58d0-89fc-fac7139ade43" "answer-fa9544c1-384a-5ecd-af3f-afa3bcc8e278" "answer-572ed2e4-92f1-55eb-b59e-1f90224a5783" "answer-3090bb90-397b-53ea-967a-773c56222b0d" "answer-7fbdb47d-afb1-582b-92ef-712071f323ad"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b47be4fa-2c44-58d0-89fc-fac7139ade43" :answer/id #uuid "b47be4fa-2c44-58d0-89fc-fac7139ade43" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt[3]{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fa9544c1-384a-5ecd-af3f-afa3bcc8e278" :answer/id #uuid "fa9544c1-384a-5ecd-af3f-afa3bcc8e278" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt[3]{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-572ed2e4-92f1-55eb-b59e-1f90224a5783" :answer/id #uuid "572ed2e4-92f1-55eb-b59e-1f90224a5783" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3090bb90-397b-53ea-967a-773c56222b0d" :answer/id #uuid "3090bb90-397b-53ea-967a-773c56222b0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\sqrt[3]{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7fbdb47d-afb1-582b-92ef-712071f323ad" :answer/id #uuid "7fbdb47d-afb1-582b-92ef-712071f323ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\sqrt[3]{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186125769 :tutorial/content "To multiply square roots, we simply multiply the numbers under the root. This is called the **product rule for radicals**.\n\nTo demonstrate, let's simplify the expression $\\sqrt{2} \\cdot \\sqrt{5}$ by applying the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{2} \\cdot \\sqrt{5} = \\sqrt{2 \\cdot 5} = \\sqrt{10}\n$$\n\nThe product rule also works for cube roots. For example,\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[3]{2} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{5} = \\sqrt[3]{2 \\cdot 5} = \\sqrt[3]{10}.\n$$\n\nIn general, the product rule works for any product of $n$th roots. So for any $n,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[n]{2} \\cdot \\sqrt[n]{5} = \\sqrt[n]{2 \\cdot 5} = \\sqrt[n]{10}.\n$$\n\n**Watch out!** We cannot use the product rule when we have the product of different radicals, such as square roots and cube roots. For example, the expression $\\sqrt{2} \\times \\sqrt[3]{5}$ cannot be simplified because the radicals $\\sqrt{\\phantom{x}}$ and $\\sqrt[3]{\\phantom{x}}$ are different." :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186125770 :tutorial/content "The product rule can often be used to simplify square roots.\n\nFor example, consider $\\sqrt{98}.$ Note that $98=49 \\cdot 2,$ where $49$ is a perfect square. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{98} = \\sqrt{49 \\cdot 2} = \\sqrt{49} \\cdot \\sqrt{2} = 7 \\sqrt{2}\n$$\n\nAlternatively, if we're given a simplified square root and we want to convert it to the square root of a single number, then we can work backwards using the product rule:\n\n$$\n7 \\sqrt{2} = \\sqrt{49} \\cdot \\sqrt{2} = \\sqrt{49 \\cdot 2} = \\sqrt{98}\n$$" :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186125771 :tutorial/content "The product rule applies to cube roots as well.\n\nFor example, consider $\\sqrt[3]{24}.$ Note that $24=8 \\cdot 3,$ where $8$ is a perfect cube. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[3]{24} = \\sqrt[3]{8 \\cdot 3} = \\sqrt[3]{8} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{3} = 2 \\sqrt[3]{3}.\n$$\n\nAgain, if we're given a simplified cube root and we want to convert it to the cube root of a single number then we can work backwards using the product rule:\n\n$$\n2 \\sqrt[3]{3} = \\sqrt[3]{8} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{3} = \\sqrt[3]{8 \\cdot 3} = \\sqrt[3]{24}\n$$" :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186124720 :activity/expected-seconds 420.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id 17592186129117 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-227caf25-9306-5c82-b372-79d6a7e8020e" "question-4e550f33-edfe-5655-939e-8622636f2991" "question-abb6e184-8089-52aa-bcbb-801153b3a890" "question-bdb711b0-2bd0-5001-9da4-0f5a8883eb97" "question-598c7e39-8f4c-5258-a940-b21dbb59f6fe"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186129120 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-83ab4791-b4e2-54a9-99f4-adcd30bf75de" "question-6d7283af-f396-5468-82fb-4bc5cf7a26db" "question-5af2aa37-0f1c-5389-a626-d55c509b3ed3" "question-1d7da2ec-c6e2-53c6-957d-270bb7c7f62a" "question-a96f6f0f-6a25-5d78-9b53-87a39a12c4cd"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186128933 :question/problem "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-2 \\\\  & x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+\\phantom{1}8x-\\phantom{1}5\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}+10x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-2x-10}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, what is $\\dfrac{2x^2+8x-5}{x+5}?$" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-2 \\\\  & x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+\\phantom{1}8x-\\phantom{1}5\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}+10x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-2x-10}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the given polynomial division, we deduce that dividing the polynomial $2x^2+8x -5$ by the linear binomial ${\\color{purple}x+5}$ gives\n\n- the quotient ${\\color{blue}2x-2},$ and\n\n- the remainder ${\\color{red}5}.$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^2+8x-5}{x+5} = {\\color{blue}2x-2}+\\dfrac{\\color{red}5}{\\color{purple}x+5}.\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186129118 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-cef5d5b2-6629-5ea4-a46e-769dfb554ec8" "question-4d09c9f5-beb6-5a3a-99b2-d8098f93c67b" "question-e5d7e360-3d1a-54c3-a890-be5694ec9bb1" "question-ad64733e-6511-5f51-b164-9b0ad359ab1e"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-227caf25-9306-5c82-b372-79d6a7e8020e" :question/id #uuid "227caf25-9306-5c82-b372-79d6a7e8020e" :question/math-academy-id "q-37911" :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & 2x-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{2}+24x-8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{2}-\\,\\,2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{26x-13}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5 \\\\  & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x+13 \\\\  & 2x-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{2}+24x-8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{2}-\\,\\,2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,26x-8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{26x-13}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5 \\\\  & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are \n\n$\\,$ $2x+13\\,$ and $\\,26x-8.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-763eb0c9-9596-5bc4-beae-809707efb349"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-763eb0c9-9596-5bc4-beae-809707efb349" :answer-field/id #uuid "763eb0c9-9596-5bc4-beae-809707efb349" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-01812b21-4ce2-59ad-94e3-558e8e94b2b1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-01812b21-4ce2-59ad-94e3-558e8e94b2b1" "answer-ef082241-d3ab-5a6b-9fe3-82132c3e806f" "answer-e52b39eb-e8a2-5baf-90a6-4296740bed34" "answer-d28644ac-b3d0-5159-a30a-f1930b5b53a6" "answer-aa0708ed-f41c-5829-8c39-023d60fdd946"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-01812b21-4ce2-59ad-94e3-558e8e94b2b1" :answer/id #uuid "01812b21-4ce2-59ad-94e3-558e8e94b2b1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$2x+13\\,$ and $\\,26x-8$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ef082241-d3ab-5a6b-9fe3-82132c3e806f" :answer/id #uuid "ef082241-d3ab-5a6b-9fe3-82132c3e806f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$2x-11\\,$ and $\\,22x-8$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e52b39eb-e8a2-5baf-90a6-4296740bed34" :answer/id #uuid "e52b39eb-e8a2-5baf-90a6-4296740bed34" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$2x-13\\,$ and $\\,2x-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d28644ac-b3d0-5159-a30a-f1930b5b53a6" :answer/id #uuid "d28644ac-b3d0-5159-a30a-f1930b5b53a6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$4x+6\\,$ and $\\,26x-8$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-aa0708ed-f41c-5829-8c39-023d60fdd946" :answer/id #uuid "aa0708ed-f41c-5829-8c39-023d60fdd946" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$4x-6\\,$ and $\\,6x-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-4e550f33-edfe-5655-939e-8622636f2991" :question/id #uuid "4e550f33-edfe-5655-939e-8622636f2991" :question/math-academy-id "q-113748" :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & 2x-3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,6{x}^{2}+\\phantom{6}5x-\\phantom{6}2\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{2}-9x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,14x-2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\boxed{}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,19 \\\\  & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x+7 \\\\  & 2x-3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,6{x}^{2}+\\phantom{6}5x-\\phantom{6}2\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{2}-9x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,14x-2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{14x-21}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,19 \\\\  & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are \n\n$\\,$ $3x+7\\,$ and $\\,14x-21.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f1c62106-d401-55b7-9f41-55e277f99169"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f1c62106-d401-55b7-9f41-55e277f99169" :answer-field/id #uuid "f1c62106-d401-55b7-9f41-55e277f99169" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-5bd375f4-426e-5f3c-ad47-976c903894ff" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1af25f4c-adcb-551d-b573-98b4a96cfd4e" "answer-25b72e68-8f83-5fef-a950-ed60a8e60a28" "answer-5bd375f4-426e-5f3c-ad47-976c903894ff" "answer-58de339c-ecf6-5dbb-904e-094bc1861076" "answer-0393905d-989a-5fa8-a997-08decd6c82c9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1af25f4c-adcb-551d-b573-98b4a96cfd4e" :answer/id #uuid "1af25f4c-adcb-551d-b573-98b4a96cfd4e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$3x+5\\,$ and $\\,15x-20$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-25b72e68-8f83-5fef-a950-ed60a8e60a28" :answer/id #uuid "25b72e68-8f83-5fef-a950-ed60a8e60a28" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$3x+6\\,$ and $\\,12x-18$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5bd375f4-426e-5f3c-ad47-976c903894ff" :answer/id #uuid "5bd375f4-426e-5f3c-ad47-976c903894ff" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$3x+7\\,$ and $\\,14x-21$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-58de339c-ecf6-5dbb-904e-094bc1861076" :answer/id #uuid "58de339c-ecf6-5dbb-904e-094bc1861076" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$3x-6\\,$ and $\\,18x-12$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0393905d-989a-5fa8-a997-08decd6c82c9" :answer/id #uuid "0393905d-989a-5fa8-a997-08decd6c82c9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$3x-7\\,$ and $\\,14x+27$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-abb6e184-8089-52aa-bcbb-801153b3a890" :question/id #uuid "abb6e184-8089-52aa-bcbb-801153b3a890" :question/math-academy-id "q-113730" :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & 2x-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}+4x+1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-4{x}^{2}+2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x+1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2x-1}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2{x}^{2}-2x+1 \\\\  & 2x-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}+4x+1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-4{x}^{2}+4x+1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-4{x}^{2}+2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x+1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2x-1}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are \n\n$\\,$ $2{x}^{2}-2x+1\\,$ and $\\,-4{x}^{2}+4x+1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a3197cb7-a9bf-557c-8d90-5f8a758cd37d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a3197cb7-a9bf-557c-8d90-5f8a758cd37d" :answer-field/id #uuid "a3197cb7-a9bf-557c-8d90-5f8a758cd37d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e5526748-76c0-563c-9189-d6ae5c135baf" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9b2625da-e958-5eac-9a20-c34b020e190d" "answer-5e971f14-87ba-5077-847a-5c6cdf159be1" "answer-5f21f279-2886-58d0-a40c-77142122dc73" "answer-e5526748-76c0-563c-9189-d6ae5c135baf" "answer-5ce55d8d-bc57-5a4a-8fa5-5b7412b96544"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9b2625da-e958-5eac-9a20-c34b020e190d" :answer/id #uuid "9b2625da-e958-5eac-9a20-c34b020e190d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$2{x}^{2}+2x+1\\,$ and $\\,4{x}^{2}+4x-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5e971f14-87ba-5077-847a-5c6cdf159be1" :answer/id #uuid "5e971f14-87ba-5077-847a-5c6cdf159be1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$2{x}^{2}+2x-1\\,$ and $\\,-4{x}^{2}-4x+1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5f21f279-2886-58d0-a40c-77142122dc73" :answer/id #uuid "5f21f279-2886-58d0-a40c-77142122dc73" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$2{x}^{2}+2x-2\\,$ and $\\,-4{x}^{2}+4x-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e5526748-76c0-563c-9189-d6ae5c135baf" :answer/id #uuid "e5526748-76c0-563c-9189-d6ae5c135baf" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$2{x}^{2}-2x+1\\,$ and $\\,-4{x}^{2}+4x+1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5ce55d8d-bc57-5a4a-8fa5-5b7412b96544" :answer/id #uuid "5ce55d8d-bc57-5a4a-8fa5-5b7412b96544" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$2{x}^{2}-2x+2\\,$ and $\\,4{x}^{2}+4x+1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-bdb711b0-2bd0-5001-9da4-0f5a8883eb97" :question/id #uuid "bdb711b0-2bd0-5001-9da4-0f5a8883eb97" :question/math-academy-id "q-105590" :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & x+4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,15{x}^{3}+74{x}^{2}+75x+80\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{15{x}^{3}+60{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{14{x}^{2}+56x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,19x+80 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{19x+76}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,15{x}^{2}+14x+19 \\\\  & x+4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,15{x}^{3}+74{x}^{2}+75x+80\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{15{x}^{3}+60{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,14{x}^{2}+75x+80 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{14{x}^{2}+56x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,19x+80 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{19x+76}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are \n\n$\\,$ $15{x}^{2}+14x+19\\,$ and $\\,14{x}^{2}+75x+80.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1e8a3481-4449-54b4-a317-baebc5257bc2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1e8a3481-4449-54b4-a317-baebc5257bc2" :answer-field/id #uuid "1e8a3481-4449-54b4-a317-baebc5257bc2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-4ca33a10-8eb2-5624-b3f7-f745d7fde067" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4ca33a10-8eb2-5624-b3f7-f745d7fde067" "answer-f0cf4b81-25a1-58ee-aa1a-0f752a743a2a" "answer-59480c4c-adcc-5fe5-9da0-f6b308bc3349" "answer-659a2cd9-8ec8-53c9-a581-1c927bea713c" "answer-822ae731-4357-53f1-bac1-a6be25e63ad8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4ca33a10-8eb2-5624-b3f7-f745d7fde067" :answer/id #uuid "4ca33a10-8eb2-5624-b3f7-f745d7fde067" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$15{x}^{2}+14x+19\\,$ and $\\,14{x}^{2}+75x+80$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f0cf4b81-25a1-58ee-aa1a-0f752a743a2a" :answer/id #uuid "f0cf4b81-25a1-58ee-aa1a-0f752a743a2a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$15{x}^{2}+14x+21\\,$ and $\\,14{x}^{2}+75x-80$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-59480c4c-adcc-5fe5-9da0-f6b308bc3349" :answer/id #uuid "59480c4c-adcc-5fe5-9da0-f6b308bc3349" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$15{x}^{2}+16x-17\\,$ and $\\,16{x}^{2}+75x+80$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-659a2cd9-8ec8-53c9-a581-1c927bea713c" :answer/id #uuid "659a2cd9-8ec8-53c9-a581-1c927bea713c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$15{x}^{2}-14x+19\\,$ and $\\,-14{x}^{2}+75x+80$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-822ae731-4357-53f1-bac1-a6be25e63ad8" :answer/id #uuid "822ae731-4357-53f1-bac1-a6be25e63ad8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$15{x}^{2}-16x-17\\,$ and $\\,-16{x}^{2}+75x+80$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-598c7e39-8f4c-5258-a940-b21dbb59f6fe" :question/id #uuid "598c7e39-8f4c-5258-a940-b21dbb59f6fe" :question/math-academy-id "q-38068" :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & 3x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{3{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+2x+4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,6{x}^{2}+2x+4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\boxed{}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6x+4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6x+4}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-2x+2 \\\\  & 3x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{3{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+2x+4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,6{x}^{2}+2x+4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,6{x}^{2}-4x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6x+4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6x+4}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are \n\n$\\,$ ${x}^{2}-2x+2\\,$ and $\\,-6{x}^{2}-4x.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5e0675ac-ffcc-5fa2-9611-c72d3057fb81"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5e0675ac-ffcc-5fa2-9611-c72d3057fb81" :answer-field/id #uuid "5e0675ac-ffcc-5fa2-9611-c72d3057fb81" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-59cb128e-8165-5a74-a2e6-8447632b54e9" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a551a0b4-801d-5320-b90a-8bb566c23b27" "answer-1a6d6d47-4c1a-54c0-97fe-343a702d6c54" "answer-8fb0433c-553a-55b0-b8f4-0ae152c8079c" "answer-b512e66f-0d89-5493-8244-73454af6f90c" "answer-59cb128e-8165-5a74-a2e6-8447632b54e9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a551a0b4-801d-5320-b90a-8bb566c23b27" :answer/id #uuid "a551a0b4-801d-5320-b90a-8bb566c23b27" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$2{x}^{2}-2x+2\\,$ and $\\,6{x}^{2}-4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1a6d6d47-4c1a-54c0-97fe-343a702d6c54" :answer/id #uuid "1a6d6d47-4c1a-54c0-97fe-343a702d6c54" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$3{x}^{2}-2x+1\\,$ and $\\,4{x}^{2}-6x$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8fb0433c-553a-55b0-b8f4-0ae152c8079c" :answer/id #uuid "8fb0433c-553a-55b0-b8f4-0ae152c8079c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$3{x}^{2}-x+2\\,$ and $\\,-6{x}^{2}+4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b512e66f-0d89-5493-8244-73454af6f90c" :answer/id #uuid "b512e66f-0d89-5493-8244-73454af6f90c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${x}^{2}-2x+1\\,$ and $\\,-4{x}^{2}+6x$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-59cb128e-8165-5a74-a2e6-8447632b54e9" :answer/id #uuid "59cb128e-8165-5a74-a2e6-8447632b54e9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${x}^{2}-2x+2\\,$ and $\\,-6{x}^{2}-4x$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-83ab4791-b4e2-54a9-99f4-adcd30bf75de" :question/id #uuid "83ab4791-b4e2-54a9-99f4-adcd30bf75de" :question/math-academy-id "q-37893" :question/problem "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+5x-3 \\\\  & 5x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,10{x}^{3}+27{x}^{2}-10x-3\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{10{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,25{x}^{2}-10x-3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{25{x}^{2}+5x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-15x-3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,15x-3}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, $\\frac{10{x}^{3}+27{x}^{2}-10x-3}{5x+1}=$" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+5x-3 \\\\  & 5x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,10{x}^{3}+27{x}^{2}-10x-3\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{10{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,25{x}^{2}-10x-3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{25{x}^{2}+5x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-15x-3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,15x-3}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the given polynomial division, we deduce that dividing the polynomial $10{x}^{3}+27{x}^{2}-10x-3$ by the linear binomial $5x+1$ gives\n\n- the quotient $2{x}^{2}+5x-3,$ and\n\n- the remainder $0.$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\frac{10{x}^{3}+27{x}^{2}-10x-3}{5x+1}=2{x}^{2}+5x-3+\\frac{0}{5x+1}=2{x}^{2}+5x-3.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-44f26335-8a65-57cc-abc1-46e970937d1d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-44f26335-8a65-57cc-abc1-46e970937d1d" :answer-field/id #uuid "44f26335-8a65-57cc-abc1-46e970937d1d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-90cb12aa-021d-559e-b6bb-ac69e1cef925" :answer-field/choices ["answer-de3d8739-eec5-5417-82f9-7d3ac2747630" "answer-40d27e4e-5da2-5e29-9896-bf0fb45e24dd" "answer-90cb12aa-021d-559e-b6bb-ac69e1cef925" "answer-707eeaf7-54c2-5d0f-a7e0-80cba3b7f0a3" "answer-12bd1910-cd28-55d6-ad47-7d4efd790c2c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-de3d8739-eec5-5417-82f9-7d3ac2747630" :answer/id #uuid "de3d8739-eec5-5417-82f9-7d3ac2747630" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}+3x+5-\\frac{3}{5x+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-40d27e4e-5da2-5e29-9896-bf0fb45e24dd" :answer/id #uuid "40d27e4e-5da2-5e29-9896-bf0fb45e24dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}+5x+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-90cb12aa-021d-559e-b6bb-ac69e1cef925" :answer/id #uuid "90cb12aa-021d-559e-b6bb-ac69e1cef925" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}+5x-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-707eeaf7-54c2-5d0f-a7e0-80cba3b7f0a3" :answer/id #uuid "707eeaf7-54c2-5d0f-a7e0-80cba3b7f0a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}+5x-3+\\frac{7}{5x+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-12bd1910-cd28-55d6-ad47-7d4efd790c2c" :answer/id #uuid "12bd1910-cd28-55d6-ad47-7d4efd790c2c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}-5x-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-6d7283af-f396-5468-82fb-4bc5cf7a26db" :question/id #uuid "6d7283af-f396-5468-82fb-4bc5cf7a26db" :question/math-academy-id "q-38074" :question/problem "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-14 \\\\  & x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}-18x-\\phantom{1}1\\,\\,\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-2{x}^{2}-4x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-14x-1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-14x-28}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,27\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, $\\frac{-2{x}^{2}-18x-1}{x+2}=$" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-14 \\\\  & x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}-18x-\\phantom{1}1\\,\\,\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-2{x}^{2}-4x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-14x-1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-14x-28}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,27\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the given polynomial division, we deduce that dividing the polynomial $-2{x}^{2}-18x-1$ by the linear binomial $x+2$ gives\n\n- the quotient $-2x-14,$ and\n\n- the remainder $27.$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\frac{-2{x}^{2}-18x-1}{x+2}=-2x-14+\\frac{27}{x+2}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4a408997-1f40-5ca8-9346-68a33d5f43ae"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4a408997-1f40-5ca8-9346-68a33d5f43ae" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a408997-1f40-5ca8-9346-68a33d5f43ae" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-92a4537e-75a4-53bd-bd2c-d625341b0c25" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6121daca-c8d6-5f33-8349-0df5c6c8e0e1" "answer-92a4537e-75a4-53bd-bd2c-d625341b0c25" "answer-c3485231-8e5e-51d2-838a-2a05f2103a24" "answer-7fd92c1c-a5b4-5d9f-9c95-22a310e80009" "answer-f3ec1ec7-c326-5c31-a5fa-2a4a18f563e9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6121daca-c8d6-5f33-8349-0df5c6c8e0e1" :answer/id #uuid "6121daca-c8d6-5f33-8349-0df5c6c8e0e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-14x-2+\\frac{26}{x+2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-92a4537e-75a4-53bd-bd2c-d625341b0c25" :answer/id #uuid "92a4537e-75a4-53bd-bd2c-d625341b0c25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2x-14+\\frac{27}{x+2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c3485231-8e5e-51d2-838a-2a05f2103a24" :answer/id #uuid "c3485231-8e5e-51d2-838a-2a05f2103a24" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3x-7+\\frac{72}{x+2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7fd92c1c-a5b4-5d9f-9c95-22a310e80009" :answer/id #uuid "7fd92c1c-a5b4-5d9f-9c95-22a310e80009" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "14x+28+\\frac{77}{x+2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f3ec1ec7-c326-5c31-a5fa-2a4a18f563e9" :answer/id #uuid "f3ec1ec7-c326-5c31-a5fa-2a4a18f563e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-1+\\frac{14}{x+2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-5af2aa37-0f1c-5389-a626-d55c509b3ed3" :question/id #uuid "5af2aa37-0f1c-5389-a626-d55c509b3ed3" :question/math-academy-id "q-320867" :question/problem "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{2}-3x+2 \\\\  & x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{3}+\\phantom{0}{x}^{2}-\\phantom{0}x+11\\,\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-3{x}^{2}-x+11 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-3{x}^{2}-3x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x+11 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2x+\\,\\,2}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, we conclude the following:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"1\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"140\">$4{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}-x+11$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"20\">$=$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"120\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"30\">$+\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"50\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\" width=\"25\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"140\">$x+1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"50\">$x+1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{2}-3x+2 \\\\  & x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{3}+\\phantom{0}{x}^{2}-\\phantom{0}x+11\\,\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-3{x}^{2}-x+11 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-3{x}^{2}-3x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x+11 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2x+\\,\\,2}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the given polynomial division, we deduce that dividing the polynomial $4{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}-x+11$ by the linear binomial $x+1$ gives\n\n- the quotient $4{x}^{2}-3x+2,$ and\n\n- the remainder $9.$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\frac{4{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}-x+11}{x+1}=4{x}^{2}-3x+2+\\frac{9}{x+1}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2e2d59ef-e005-55b3-a36c-a89aee007073" "answer-field-6b8c8237-9806-5c39-b08e-87d13938a5f1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2e2d59ef-e005-55b3-a36c-a89aee007073" :answer-field/id #uuid "2e2d59ef-e005-55b3-a36c-a89aee007073" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-1c01b52c-bca9-512b-9f6e-d7dd4ecd8424" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1c01b52c-bca9-512b-9f6e-d7dd4ecd8424"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1c01b52c-bca9-512b-9f6e-d7dd4ecd8424" :answer/id #uuid "1c01b52c-bca9-512b-9f6e-d7dd4ecd8424" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4x^{2}-3x+2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6b8c8237-9806-5c39-b08e-87d13938a5f1" :answer-field/id #uuid "6b8c8237-9806-5c39-b08e-87d13938a5f1" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-82bb9b44-a65f-583d-86e0-2c7bd8170473" :answer-field/choices ["answer-82bb9b44-a65f-583d-86e0-2c7bd8170473"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-82bb9b44-a65f-583d-86e0-2c7bd8170473" :answer/id #uuid "82bb9b44-a65f-583d-86e0-2c7bd8170473" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-1d7da2ec-c6e2-53c6-957d-270bb7c7f62a" :question/id #uuid "1d7da2ec-c6e2-53c6-957d-270bb7c7f62a" :question/math-academy-id "q-270261" :question/problem "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5x-8 \\\\  & x+3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,5{x}^{2}+\\phantom{0}7x+\\phantom{0}8\\,\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{5{x}^{2}+15x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-8x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{8x-24}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,32\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, we conclude the following:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"1\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">$5{x}^{2}+7x+8$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"20\">$=$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"30\">$+\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"50\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\" width=\"25\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">$x+3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">$x+3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5x-8 \\\\  & x+3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,5{x}^{2}+\\phantom{0}7x+\\phantom{0}8\\,\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{5{x}^{2}+15x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-8x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{8x-24}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,32\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the given polynomial division, we deduce that dividing the polynomial $5{x}^{2}+7x+8$ by the linear binomial $x+3$ gives\n\n- the quotient $5x-8,$ and\n\n- the remainder $32.$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\frac{5{x}^{2}+7x+8}{x+3}=5x-8+\\frac{32}{x+3}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-641dfae7-301e-52fe-a948-73200d0d1dc5" "answer-field-ddea1062-b353-5b96-a157-ce968af65b6a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-641dfae7-301e-52fe-a948-73200d0d1dc5" :answer-field/id #uuid "641dfae7-301e-52fe-a948-73200d0d1dc5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-da104913-e105-5612-9649-6f505b4f60e3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-da104913-e105-5612-9649-6f505b4f60e3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-da104913-e105-5612-9649-6f505b4f60e3" :answer/id #uuid "da104913-e105-5612-9649-6f505b4f60e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x-8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ddea1062-b353-5b96-a157-ce968af65b6a" :answer-field/id #uuid "ddea1062-b353-5b96-a157-ce968af65b6a" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-55b9f63f-0b84-5385-9a32-8b1de9393d6c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-55b9f63f-0b84-5385-9a32-8b1de9393d6c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-55b9f63f-0b84-5385-9a32-8b1de9393d6c" :answer/id #uuid "55b9f63f-0b84-5385-9a32-8b1de9393d6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "32" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-a96f6f0f-6a25-5d78-9b53-87a39a12c4cd" :question/id #uuid "a96f6f0f-6a25-5d78-9b53-87a39a12c4cd" :question/math-academy-id "q-114148" :question/problem "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x+11 \\\\  & x-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{2}+\\phantom{1}8x-\\phantom{1}4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{2}-3x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,11x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{11x-11}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, $\\frac{3{x}^{2}+8x-4}{x-1}=$" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x+11 \\\\  & x-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{2}+\\phantom{1}8x-\\phantom{1}4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{2}-3x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,11x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{11x-11}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the given polynomial division, we deduce that dividing the polynomial $3{x}^{2}+8x-4$ by the linear binomial $x-1$ gives\n\n- the quotient $3x+11,$ and\n\n- the remainder $7.$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\frac{3{x}^{2}+8x-4}{x-1}=3x+11+\\frac{7}{x-1}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3e5fb3aa-3a5e-5f42-bac6-2ecaea522399"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3e5fb3aa-3a5e-5f42-bac6-2ecaea522399" :answer-field/id #uuid "3e5fb3aa-3a5e-5f42-bac6-2ecaea522399" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a3bb9d15-c479-5aca-9dbb-ed0a6d1795dd" :answer-field/choices ["answer-edf23cb8-350f-5c93-a781-ac22fc443294" "answer-a3bb9d15-c479-5aca-9dbb-ed0a6d1795dd" "answer-a0411c5d-b798-576c-9063-a08e3c6615e5" "answer-c4eedbca-0e88-5e5f-bbf2-30b15a6fb325" "answer-e965a6b8-f562-532c-875e-a3bdc36d1264"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-edf23cb8-350f-5c93-a781-ac22fc443294" :answer/id #uuid "edf23cb8-350f-5c93-a781-ac22fc443294" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x+10-\\frac{4}{x-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a3bb9d15-c479-5aca-9dbb-ed0a6d1795dd" :answer/id #uuid "a3bb9d15-c479-5aca-9dbb-ed0a6d1795dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x+11+\\frac{7}{x-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a0411c5d-b798-576c-9063-a08e3c6615e5" :answer/id #uuid "a0411c5d-b798-576c-9063-a08e3c6615e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x+12-\\frac{8}{x-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c4eedbca-0e88-5e5f-bbf2-30b15a6fb325" :answer/id #uuid "c4eedbca-0e88-5e5f-bbf2-30b15a6fb325" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x-13+\\frac{5}{x-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e965a6b8-f562-532c-875e-a3bdc36d1264" :answer/id #uuid "e965a6b8-f562-532c-875e-a3bdc36d1264" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x-14-\\frac{6}{x-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-cef5d5b2-6629-5ea4-a46e-769dfb554ec8" :question/id #uuid "cef5d5b2-6629-5ea4-a46e-769dfb554ec8" :question/math-academy-id "q-37962" :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & x+3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-4x+\\phantom{1}0\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,3{x}^{2}-4x+0 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,3{x}^{2}-9x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{5x+15}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,15\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$-term and the constant term. So, we write it using a zero coefficient, as follows:\n\n$$\n{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-4x+0\n$$\n\nUsing the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-3x+5 \\\\  & x+3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-4x+\\phantom{1}0\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,3{x}^{2}-4x+0 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,3{x}^{2}-9x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5x+0 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{5x+15}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,15\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are\n\n$\\,$ ${x}^{2}-3x+5\\,$ and $\\,5x+0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4dfddf89-cb53-53d6-b1cb-c4915d35d4af"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4dfddf89-cb53-53d6-b1cb-c4915d35d4af" :answer-field/id #uuid "4dfddf89-cb53-53d6-b1cb-c4915d35d4af" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-5f9d7713-3036-58bc-9aae-4e2c571f059d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-dbd8932f-525a-5d8f-b046-0cd6b41e0bbd" "answer-e5b0d648-9017-5564-82d1-ffd713a93731" "answer-5f9d7713-3036-58bc-9aae-4e2c571f059d" "answer-d8bc22b9-8843-51e4-95e8-8b4fa273adf2" "answer-7272d4d7-e192-57a2-87cf-7e4